{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1300650/extras/f49cc78eb6ed595686dafe5d03f11ba6.webp?t=1762646270\" width=200 height=40 /></span>              <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1300650/extras/4736ab0b052831ea18b59ac2bd3a4256.poster.avif?t=1762646270\" width=300 height=40 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1300650/extras/4736ab0b052831ea18b59ac2bd3a4256.webm?t=1762646270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rat. A plank. And absolutely no idea what\u2019s going on. One moment Rodent is running for cover, the next he\u2019s a hot pink, gun-toting force of nature with a weapon that fuses fire, lasers, and explosives. Now everyone wants Plank back, especially a group of storybook knights carrying strange orbs and even stranger intentions. The deeper Rodent goes, the weirder things get, and it\u2019s becoming clear that Plank is a lot more than just a piece of wood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1300650/extras/3f5e3ee967674f1cf32c3a154f168070.poster.avif?t=1762646270\" width=360 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1300650/extras/3f5e3ee967674f1cf32c3a154f168070.webm?t=1762646270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1300650/extras/3f5e3ee967674f1cf32c3a154f168070.mp4?t=1762646270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u00a0<br>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1300650/extras/5fea365e803f6b938a85afee76928229.webp?t=1762646270\" width=200 height=40 /></span>              <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1300650/extras/4736ab0b052831ea18b59ac2bd3a4256.poster.avif?t=1762646270\" width=300 height=40 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1300650/extras/4736ab0b052831ea18b59ac2bd3a4256.webm?t=1762646270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build wild weapons. Wreck everything. When that\u2019s not enough, throw a grenade or drop a screen-clearing blast that leaves nothing standing. No subtlety, all boom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1300650/extras/1872d0cfdda974d8a9bdaf31614a28e5.poster.avif?t=1762646270\" width=200 height=79 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1300650/extras/1872d0cfdda974d8a9bdaf31614a28e5.webm?t=1762646270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rodent and Plank doesn\u2019t repeat itself. Every level shifts the rules with new mechanics, strange enemies, and wild set pieces. One minute you're piloting a submarine through hostile waters. The next, you're falling into the mouth of something enormous and angry. It never lets you get comfortable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1300650/extras/56ef5367c0e12c341b5d20eab4e55d66.poster.avif?t=1762646270\" width=292 height=191 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1300650/extras/56ef5367c0e12c341b5d20eab4e55d66.webm?t=1762646270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rodent and Plank\u2019s soundtrack blends electronic beats with gritty textures to create something strange and unforgettable. It drives the action, shapes the atmosphere, and gives every moment a pulse. From big boss fights to eerie calm, the music keeps the world alive and buzzing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1300650/extras/4736ab0b052831ea18b59ac2bd3a4256.poster.avif?t=1762646270\" width=300 height=40 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1300650/extras/4736ab0b052831ea18b59ac2bd3a4256.webm?t=1762646270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rodent and Plank plays hard, but it plays fair. You\u2019ll feel every dodge and every mistake. If that\u2019s not your thing, no problem. You can turn the difficulty up, down, or sideways. How much punishment you take is entirely up to you.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1300650?t=1762646270","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1300650/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762646270","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1300650/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762646270","cap