2019t repeat itself. Every level shifts the rules with new mechanics, strange enemies, and wild set pieces. One minute you're piloting a submarine through hostile waters. The next, you're falling into the mouth of something enormous and angry. It never lets you get comfortable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1300650/extras/56ef5367c0e12c341b5d20eab4e55d66.poster.avif?t=1762646270\" width=292 height=191 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1300650/extras/56ef5367c0e12c341b5d20eab4e55d66.webm?t=1762646270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rodent and Plank\u2019s soundtrack blends electronic beats with gritty textures to create something strange and unforgettable. It drives the action, shapes the atmosphere, and gives every moment a pulse. From big boss fights to eerie calm, the music keeps the world alive and buzzing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1300650/extras/4736ab0b052831ea18b59ac2bd3a4256.poster.avif?t=1762646270\" width=300 height=40 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1300650/extras/4736ab0b052831ea18b59ac2bd3a4256.webm?t=1762646270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rodent and Plank plays hard, but it plays fair. You\u2019ll feel every dodge and every mistake. If that\u2019s not your thing, no problem. You can turn the difficulty up, down, or sideways. How much punishment you take is entirely up to you.</p>","developers":["Lodder Digital Media"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1300650/header.jpg?t=1762646270","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 12.04<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD or NVIDIA videocard with at least 512MB, or Intel HD Graphics<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 256 MB video card<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Supports Microsoft\u00ae Xbox 360 controller or Direct Input compatible controller</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1300650/362626/8d894e6c39f75c8ea091546f8c00bc20193f21ce/1751217960/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761647165","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1300650/362626/8d894e6c39f75c8ea091546f8c00bc20193f21ce/1751217960/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761647165","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1300650/362626/8d894e6c39f75c8ea091546f8c00bc20193f21ce/1751217960/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761647165","id":256830948,"name":"Rodent & Plank Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256830948/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1761647165"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1300650/331709/a1dfc03dfc59924260869a850366c54cb1a22282/1751217953/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761647167","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1300650/331709/a1dfc03dfc59924260869a85036